# Testing

## Do

- Add or extend a regression test in `tests/` for every bug fix.
- Add unit tests for new or changed validators and service behavior.
- Add integration tests under `tests/integration/` for new or changed routes.
- Run `npm test` before marking backend work complete.

## Do not

- Delete or skip failing tests to pass CI.
- Ship API behavior changes without tests when tests are required by the change type above.
